  "atomic_questions": [
    "What is the objective of this analysis — are we maximizing the total value of exports (i.e., the value of domestically produced goods sold on the world market)?",
    "Is the value measured at the world-market prices you listed (steel 500, engines 1500, electronic components 300, plastic 1200 Klunz per unit)?"
  ],
  "rationale": "The response asks for the objective (maximizing export value) and separately asks for confirmation of the specific prices used to measure that value. These are distinct pieces of information that could be answered independently."
}

