  ],
  "rationale": "The response asks for confirmation of a single specific working assumption regarding GDP calculation. Although it contains two grammatical clauses ('may I proceed...' and 'is that reading acceptable...'), they seek the same binary confirmation of the same premise, making it one semantically independent question."
}

